                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-pitfalls",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Avoiding Common Pitfalls in Fleet Management",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "pitfalls"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-pitfalls-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fleet owners know the pressure of keeping everything running smoothly. But even experienced managers can make mistakes that lead to inefficiencies or safety risks.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "cards-pitfalls-2",
                  "type": "card-lists",
                  "props": {
                    "variant": "feature",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "title": "Waiting Too Long to Schedule Maintenance",
                        "intro": "Putting off service may seem like a time-saver, but it often results in breakdowns at the worst possible time. <a href=\"/service-appointment\">Scheduling maintenance</a> proactively saves time, money, and frustration.",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Relying on Multiple Vendors",
                        "intro": "When your fleet is serviced by several shops, tracking repairs and maintenance history becomes chaotic. With Sun State International, you get centralized records and consistent quality across every truck.",
                        "points": []
                      },
                      {
                        "title": "Skipping Driver Feedback",
                        "intro": "Your drivers are often the first to notice unusual noises, poor performance, or handling issues. Create a feedback loop where drivers report problems quickly and get them addressed without delay.",
                        "points": []
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-who-benefits",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Who Benefits from Fleet Services?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "who-benefits"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-who-benefits-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Sun State International works with a wide range of customers across Florida, including:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-who-benefits-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Owner-operators who want to protect their investment and grow their business"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Logistics managers oversee large fleets with tight delivery windows"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Construction firms with specialized trucks that require attentive care"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "School districts that prioritize safe, consistent maintenance"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "And so many more."
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-who-benefits-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "No matter your business size, our services are built to scale and support you as you grow.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-partner",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Partner with Sun State International and Drive Forward",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "partner"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-partner-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At <a href=\"/our-story\">Sun State International</a>, we go beyond basic service. Our fleet programs are built around real customer needs: efficiency, accountability, and trust. We know every hour your trucks spend in the shop is an hour off the road. That’s why we act fast, communicate clearly, and put your business goals first. <a href=\"/contact\">If you’re ready to work with a dependable partner that knows Florida trucking, Sun State International is here to help.</a>",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-partner-2",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
